OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 21 dies and another injured
OL,4,Aafter city centre assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has died and another
OL,7,Fhas been injured following an incident
OL,8,Fin Glasgow City Centre.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fdisturbance in Royal Exchange Square at
OL,12,Fabout 03:05 on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe force said the 21-year-old was
OL,15,Fseriously injured during the assault.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital where he died
OL,17,Fon Monday.
OL,19,FA 19-year-old man was arrested in
OL,20,Fconnection with the disturbance but
OL,21,Freleased pending further inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
